// TOL_LOOP 500 KPA: THE ITERATION STOPS 21 KPA OUT OF BALANCE ROUND A LOOP.  WAS ACCEPTED.
// EXPECT: 3 REJECTED
UNITS LENGTH M
UNITS ELEVATION M
UNITS SIZE MM
UNITS PRESSURE KPA
UNITS FLOW LPM
UNITS KFACTOR LPM/KPA
METHOD HW
USE BORE 120
OPTION TOL_LOOP 500
OPTION TOL_FLOW 500
WATER S 0 700
NODE A 0
NODE B 0
NODE C 0
SPRINKLER H 0 -50 80
PIPE P1 S A 10 100
PIPE P2 A B 50 50
PIPE P3 A C 20 25
PIPE P4 C B 20 25
PIPE P5 B H 5 50
